            "review_title": "Review at Ga Bay Sports Beer Garden",
            "review_text": "Work n Travel\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam106 contributions\n0\nDelicious food and cheaply plantinium beer tower\nJan 2016 • Friends\nOpen space restaurant with most of dish made from chicken. Not so many people at the time we visited. Will come back again. \n\nThere is one fun challenging game that you should to try: 1 person eat 6 pieces of super spicy chicken and drink 3 glasses of beer in 6 mins. If you win, you will have 6 beer towers for free. If you cant, you just pay for chicken and 3 glasses of beer. \n\nHighly recommend you start this at the beginning of party. Best luck to you :)\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
